WEBVTT

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.040
<b>R-Ren...</b>

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.640
<b>Do you still think you're strong?</b>

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.730
<b>Accept your defeat.</b>

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.610
<b>I can't watch this anymore...</b>

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:36.990
<b>Old man.</b>

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.830
<b>Yoh's dad or not, I can't sit back
and not do anything any longer.</b>

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.000
<b>Horohoro...</b>

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.090
<b>You're not going to get a turn.</b>

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:54.050
<b>Ugh...</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:01.310
<b>I will not waver.</b>

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.350
<b>That's my answer...</b>

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:10.690
<b>Asakura Mikihisa!</b>

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.200
<b>You've done it, Ren-kun.</b>

