00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.030
<b>Episode 27</b>

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.030
<b>Episode 27</b>

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.030
<b>Farewell Forever</b>

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.030
<b>Farewell Forever</b>

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:53.500
<b>He finally got a hit on him.</b>

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.500
<b>But then...</b>

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.010
<b>You've set up this whole
thing to get to this point.</b>

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.600
<b>I don't know what you mean.</b>

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:09.850
<b>Are you willing to learn the
Ultra Senji Ryakketsu now?</b>

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:11.940
<b>No.</b>

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.770
<b>You won't teach me...</b>

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.820
<b>I'll take it from you!</b>

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.130
<b>Hey, Ren.</b>

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.760
<b>How long are you gonna pout?</b>

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.720
<b>He's a monster.</b>

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:47.600
<b>Eat up!</b>

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:51.270
<b>Do you like Mickey's
special mountain barbeque?</b>

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:53.850
<b>It's delicious!</b>

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.150
<b>You can't fight on an empty stomach.</b>

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.700
<b>Try it, it's good.</b>

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:08.870
<b>No, I don't want your charity.</b>

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.160
<b>Hahaha! I thought you'd say that.</b>

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.000
<b>You're stubborn.</b>

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:17.130
<b>Just like your father.</b>

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.710
<b>You defeated my father, too?</b>

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:28.390
<b>Hmm well... It's more
like he self-destructed.</b>

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:33.980
<b>But that was just because
he had so much Furyoku!</b>

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:39.110
<b>So what's in Mickey's
secret sauce, anyway?</b>

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.820
<b>Shut up, Horohoro.</b>

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.650
<b>Tell me one thing...</b>

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:52.200
<b>Why would such powerful adults
leave the fate of the world to children?</b>

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.460
<b>Because we adults know our ceiling.</b>

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:04.300
<b>When people grow up,
they start noticing it...</b>

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:09.470
<b>They discover their ceiling,
the limit of their potential.</b>

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:17.150
<b>It gets ever closer as we age, so
close that we can see the stains on it.</b>

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:18.270
<b>Huh?</b>

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:23.230
<b>But you can't see
your ceilings yet...</b>

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:26.030
<b>And it's better that way.</b>

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:32.200
<b>The only thing hanging over you is the
infinite sky, grow as strong as you need to be!</b>

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:35.800
<b>That's why I told you not
to jump to conclusions.</b>

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.710
<b>But you already knew...</b>

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.380
<b>That your just another weak person.</b>

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.800
<b>Lots of people are stronger than me.</b>

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:53.010
<b>This tournament has made that clear.</b>

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:56.520
<b>I'm not so stupid
to be blind to that.</b>

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:58.940
<b>Ren...</b>

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:03.190
<b>But that doesn't mean I accept it...</b>

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.550
<b>That would destroy any
hope I have of victory.</b>

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:11.450
<b>That's why I'll keep
going, even if it kills me.</b>

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:17.460
<b>I will go on believing in my
strength and I will not waver</b>

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.840
<b>You just lost, what
are you saying?</b>

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.260
<b>Shut up, idiot!</b>

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.550
<b>That's exactly why you were
able to see my technique.</b>

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.850
<b>It seems I underestimated you.</b>

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:41.150
<b>So Mickey, will you
teach us the secret, too?</b>

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.360
<b>How'd you dodge
all of Ren's moves?</b>

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:49.200
<b>I wish I could walk you
through it step by step...</b>

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:53.160
<b>But I'm afraid I'll have to
teach you through combat.</b>

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.950
<b>Don't stand there gawking.</b>

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:01.330
<b>It looks like your hobo barbeque...</b>

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:04.420
<b>Attracted some guests.</b>

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:07.510
<b>You're right.</b>

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:14.010
<b>He's brave, Hao-sama
was right about him.</b>

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.520
<b>You're a cheeky one, Tao Ren.</b>

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:19.230
<b>What's the Patch tribe doing here?</b>

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:22.020
<b>What does he mean "Hao-sama"?!</b>

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:23.270
<b>Idiots</b>

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:26.520
<b>Can't you feel the
blood lust in their Furyoku?</b>

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:30.070
<b>Those aren't regular Patch</b>

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.740
<b>It's time to hunt souls.</b>

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.950
<b>You won't be learning any
more of the Ultra Senji Ryakketsu.</b>

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.040
<b>Give me that.</b>

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.370
<b>You can't fight on an empty stomach.</b>

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:51.420
<b>He's late.</b>

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.390
<b>That damn Mickey...</b>

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:57.930
<b>We're all members of team
Kabbalahers, what's he doing?</b>

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.930
<b>If he doesn't show,
we'll lose the match!</b>

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.820
<b>What's wrong, Yoh-kun?</b>

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:11.690
<b>Hehe, our old friend is back.</b>

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:17.120
<b>Really? Nothing good
happens when he's around.</b>

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:22.080
<b>Long time no see, Silva!</b>

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.710
<b>Huh?</b>

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:28.340
<b>Isn't it time for your match?</b>

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:29.960
<b>Mickey Asakura</b>

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:31.920
<b>Mickey Asakura?</b>

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:33.840
<b>That's my ring name.</b>

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:38.300
<b>I'm also participating
in the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.350
<b>But my real objective is to defeat Hao.</b>

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:48.520
<b>If I must defeat you to
get to my match, so be it.</b>

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:50.650
<b>Mickey!</b>

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.110
<b>Don't get us wrong.</b>

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:54.650
<b>We're still Patch Officiants.</b>

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:58.870
<b>The Shaman Fight is a battle for the Great Spirit.</b>

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.080
<b>We would never
attack participants.</b>

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.960
<b>In other words, it's not us
you have to worry about.</b>

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:07.580
<b>It's me.</b>

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.920
<b>Isn't that Peyote, we've
already beaten him!</b>

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:16.090
<b>Él es correcto.</b>

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:21.970
<b>I have to time to kill so I
volunteered for this mission ♪</b>

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.430
<b>I will take your souls ♪</b>

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:28.150
<b>And feed them to the Spirit of Fire ♪</b>

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:34.570
<b>This is for Hao-sama, I will do
whatever I can to aid him.  ♪</b>

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:38.160
<b>Long time no see! ♪</b>

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.910
<b>Those guys again...</b>

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:44.660
<b>Don't complain, Zang Ching. This is duty.</b>

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.080
<b>You're late.</b>

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:49.420
<b>This is why I don't like Mariachis.</b>

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:54.550
<b>I had to shave, you should
be grateful we came at all.</b>

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.340
<b>This is...</b>

00:09:57.090 --> 00:10:00.970
<b>Now then, Magna. You
can go, we'll handle this.</b>

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.770
<b>I'll keep an eye on this.</b>

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:06.230
<b>All right.</b>

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:09.770
<b>But I may not be needed there.</b>

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:13.440
<b>You see, that team is dependable.</b>

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:19.860
<b>The souls of Mickey Asakura's
teammates are as good as caught.</b>

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.990
<b>Redseb, Seyram!</b>

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:29.960
<b>You would murder innocent children?</b>

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:35.670
<b>They're not children, they're powerful
Shamans who made it to the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:41.430
<b>To the Spirit of Fire, it doesn't
matter if you're an adult or child.</b>

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:45.180
<b>What did you..?!</b>

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:47.640
<b>Ren-kun!</b>

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.310
<b>Calm down</b>

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:53.770
<b>Don't waste time here,
go help your teammates.</b>

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:56.730
<b>Don't worry about us.</b>

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:01.200
<b>I've already learned your techniques.</b>

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.740
<b>I can deal with this bunch myself.</b>

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:07.750
<b>But...</b>

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.290
<b>All right.</b>

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.720
<b>But they've got something up their sleeve.</b>

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.090
<b>Don't assume anything...</b>

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:19.920
<b>Hi-Yo, Mountain Gods!</b>

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:21.800
<b>Mickey!</b>

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:24.350
<b>I should be going, too.</b>

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:27.890
<b>Can you handle this on your own, Nickrome?</b>

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:31.600
<b>Of course, Magna-san</b>

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:37.150
<b>Boring, why is everything so boring.</b>

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.360
<b>I thought we were
finally going to see action.</b>

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:44.780
<b>And this is what we get?</b>

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.830
<b>It's so pathetic, I could cry.</b>

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:47.830
<b>Huh?</b>

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.040
<b>Wh-Who are you?!</b>

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.080
<b>Ugh... Shut up.</b>

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:58.170
<b>Why?!</b>

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.170
<b>This is why I hate kids.</b>

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:06.180
<b>Can you just sit still and listen?</b>

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:10.470
<b>We just need your souls, okay?</b>

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:14.520
<b>So could you please just, like, drop dead?</b>

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.770
<b>Actually, I wish you'd fight back harder.</b>

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:22.030
<b>That way it wouldn't be so boring!</b>

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:24.320
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:41.090
<b>So this is what Silva was talking about.</b>

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:43.760
<b>If you're so bored...</b>

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.840
<b>We'll play with you.</b>

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.570
<b>This is gonna be a pain.</b>

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:05.650
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:09.070
<b>Let's just kill them and break for lunch...</b>

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:11.830
<b>Xiong Xiong.</b>

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.110
<b>What?</b>

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:13.950
<b>Panda?!</b>

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.210
<b>Hey!</b>

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.330
<b>Hot!</b>

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.340
<b>He came outta nowhere!</b>

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:25.670
<b>Of course, this isn't a match.</b>

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:29.050
<b>And he's not just a cute Panda.</b>

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:30.850
<b>My Over Soul...</b>

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:33.100
<b>Gong Xiong Mao, is...</b>

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:37.350
<b>You're right, this isn't a match.</b>

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.900
<b>You bastard!</b>

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:42.860
<b>I was trying to be nice!</b>

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:45.610
<b>Black Panda Paw!</b>

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:52.080
<b>You agree?</b>

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.620
<b>That's it?</b>

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.000
<b>Beam!</b>

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.210
<b>Ren!</b>

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:09.010
<b>That's an odd trick.</b>

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.100
<b>Is that your medium?</b>

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:12.810
<b>What's your Spirit Ally?</b>

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:18.060
<b>Oh well, never mind.</b>

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:22.980
<b>Beam!</b>

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.750
<b>That's dangerous. Don't
point that thing at me.</b>

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:41.080
<b>Thanks</b>

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:45.300
<b>Hey... what's
going on?</b>

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:46.840
<b>I don't know.</b>

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:50.050
<b>But he was moving in a weird way.</b>

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.350
<b>Did Ren actually learn Mickey's technique?</b>

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:57.430
<b>Long ago, generals would
study changes in the heavens...</b>

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:01.560
<b>To lead their armies
in auspicious directions.</b>

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:06.610
<b>If you can discern the changes
in an enemy's Furyoku...</b>

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:10.110
<b>You can use that knowledge
to guide your attacks.</b>

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:14.460
<b>In the Ultra Senji Ryakketsu,
this kind of divination is called...</b>

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:17.310
The Shamanic Oracle.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:16.700
<b>The Shamanic Oracle.</b>

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.580
<b>You're good, Tao Ren.</b>

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:25.040
<b>You've figured out how to
ride the wave of Furyoku.</b>

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.000
<b>Then you know...</b>

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.170
<b>The Shamanic Oracle...</b>

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:32.640
<b>It's the first technique
Hao-sama teaches us.</b>

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:36.470
<b>Everyone in our group can do it.</b>

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:40.890
<b>To be honest, I'm surprised.</b>

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:43.900
<b>I didn't think he would be this good.</b>

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:47.610
<b>Hao-sama knew it from the start...</b>

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:53.530
<b>When he knocked out Peyote, he
knew that Ren possessed real talent.</b>

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.330
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.500
<b>That was just a match.</b>

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.500
<b>And for your
information, I didn't lose.</b>

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.380
<b>What?</b>

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.380
<b>Wh-What?</b>

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.170
<b>Don't be a sore loser!</b>

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:13.880
<b>I'm still alive, aren't I?</b>

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:23.600
<b>As long as I live, I will follow Hao-sama
and continue to be your enemy.</b>

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:29.020
<b>In other words, until you kill
me, you will have no victory.</b>

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:35.240
<b>Damn, he's such a coward.</b>

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:40.490
<b>He could've killed us with
those attacks if he wanted to.</b>

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:46.790
<b>The Tao Ren who killed his brother, Chrom the
officiant, wouldn't have spared our lives.</b>

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:50.800
<b>What?</b>

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.760
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:55.300
<b>Tao Ren.</b>

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:03.680
<b>My brother Chrom, was too lax during the
prelims, so much so that he lost his life.</b>

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.880
<b>What a pathetic loser.</b>

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.190
<b>What a fool.</b>

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:14.280
<b>I've no need of your approval.</b>

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:20.580
<b>I'll destroy you and take what I need!</b>

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:27.710
<b>See?</b>

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:31.000
<b>He who lives, laughs last.</b>

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:39.010
<b>Five hot mariachis</b>

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:44.220
<b>A mobile corpse fortress
supported by our friendship.</b>

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:48.690
<b>I call it, Grande Fantasma.</b>

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.320
<b>Its blade impales my foes.</b>

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.410
<b>Its name is Grande Fantasma.</b>

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:07.120
<b>Adios Eternamente
(Farewell Forever)</b>

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:12.170
<b>Ren...</b>

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:15.800
<b>Oops, right through the mid line.</b>

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:20.970
<b>He's history, his spinal
cords and aorta are wrecked.</b>

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:25.600
<b>Heh, hearing Chrom's
name must've rattled him.</b>

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.770
<b>He was so shocked, he didn't
see Grande Fantasma coming.</b>

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.020
<b>What are you saying, idiot?</b>

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:37.570
<b>I was in stealth mode, just as
the Ultra Senji Ryakketsu suggests!</b>

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:48.290
<b>H-hey, what are you doing, Ren?</b>

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:50.210
<b>Stop joking.</b>

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:54.590
<b>It's like that thing Mickey did, isn't it?</b>

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:59.260
<b>Haha good one, but enough's enough.</b>

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:02.050
<b>We get it now.</b>

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:05.810
<b>Get up, Ren.</b>

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:10.390
<b>Hahaha...</b>

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.280
<b>Ren...</b>

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:21.240
<b>An Over Soul casts no shadow.</b>

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:24.740
<b>Hehe, too bad.</b>

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.540
<b>That's the real him.</b>

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.040
<b>He's going to die.</b>

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:35.500
<b>His soul tenaciously clings to his body...</b>

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.630
<b>But the death of his flesh is inevitable.</b>

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:41.840
<b>And now Peyote.</b>

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:45.180
<b>Time to dispose of the other two...</b>

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:55.900
<b>We're not giving up that easy.</b>

00:19:56.610 --> 00:20:00.940
<b>Ren's still alive and we know a good doctor.</b>

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:06.200
<b>We'll bust you guys up and
get Ren the help he needs.</b>

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:09.080
<b>C'mon Kororo!</b>

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:11.080
<b>Let's fly, Mick!</b>

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:13.960
<b>SHAFT!</b>

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:18.500
<b>Naikefuike Kiroro!</b>

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:24.590
<b>2100, the last one was 1975</b>

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:28.390
<b>Hehe, don't waste your breath on them.</b>

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:33.020
<b>What was that punch?</b>

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:36.770
<b>Make your Over Souls first.</b>

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:38.690
<b>Here's a new one!</b>

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.820
<b>Double Black Panda Paws!</b>

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:47.160
<b>They're too weak.</b>

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:48.660
<b>Die.</b>

00:20:56.290 --> 00:21:00.550
<b>Enough, it's time to finish them.</b>

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.220
<b>But what do we have here?</b>

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:07.720
<b>Ice?</b>

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:11.970
<b>Is Ren okay?</b>

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:13.480
<b>You saved us.</b>

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:16.690
<b>Your ice stopped the bleeding.</b>

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:19.440
<b>It was your speed that saved us.</b>

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:22.110
<b>But we're not out of the woods yet.</b>

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:25.240
<b>I just used up most of my Furyoku.</b>

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:28.450
<b>Anyway, this ice is melting fast.</b>

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:31.120
<b>I can't do it again.</b>

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:33.290
<b>We're in trouble.</b>

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:36.460
<b>Mickey was right.</b>

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:39.390
<b>Those guys did have something up their sleeve.</b>

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:42.590
<b>That giant skeleton...</b>

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:48.590
<b>And the brother of the officiant Ren killed...</b>

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:50.890
<b>Shit...</b>

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:53.890
<b>I can't believe this happened to Ren.</b>

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:56.640
<b>Lalala</b>

00:21:57.100 --> 00:22:02.190
<b>That's the difference
between you and me.</b>

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:06.900
<b>Your time has come.</b>

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:12.200
<b>Are you ready?</b>

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:34.740
No matter how ‎‎hard and cruel the dark cave is, I always say your words‎

